content
first =~ built                           True
first !~ second                          True
first < second                           True
second > first                           True
first <> second                          -1

identity
first == built                           False
first == first                           True

case
shouting =~ first                        False
shouting.to_lower() =~ first.to_lower()  True
string.compare(shouting, first, ignore_case) 0

numeric strings compare as text
"10" < "9"                               True
10 < 9                                   False
